  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The dealer is proficient with all simple and martial weapons and with all light armor but not proficient with any heavier armor or shields. In addition, a dealer is proficient with any weapon he conjures via a dealer class feature (such as cue balls and cards).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/dealer#toc1\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
